e anything for your love this death isn't all bad . Just fate was not on your side this time. Not all things are justifiable", "timestamp": 1793447286, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sl3epy_boo", "author_id": "60165901796", "id": "18497471068096875", "text": "Redbull *no context needed", "timestamp": 1793442291, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "surya070689", "author_id": "36823095666", "id": "18126166376511248", "text": "The vikramarka said that none of the  above.. this type of sin will give to those people who spread gossips on others..", "timestamp": 1793441113, "like_count": 9}, {"author": "sica_.2", "author_id": "26646316108", "id": "18115341359463163", "text": "The birdman that took his wife", "timestamp": 1793425937, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "dusky_ey", "author_id": "44431939688", "id": "17942093913383800", "text": "Is this AI?", "timestamp": 1793423188, "like_count": 12}, {"author": "swordfighter_rah", "author_id": "64617188710", "id": "18113423345582443", "text": "Never leave your food /drinks unattended bro 🥴", "timestamp": 1793420004, "like_count": 29}, {"author": "abhisekhbaral", "author_id": "11863134251", "id": "18150232156566180", "text": ".", "timestamp": 1793413193, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "seashells._.ontheseashore", "author_id": "16668144708", "id": "18154241299553533", "text": "The woman's husband is guilty cause he blamed the innocent woman bear the responsibility for the injustice without knowing what actually happened. The hawk didn't poison the food the snake was already dead and the wife served the food whole heartedly with the intention of helping someone but the husband didn't know about those events yet decided to accuse his wife.", "timestamp": 1793376663, "like_count": 98}, {"author": "sh.reya_11", "author_id": "10000024121", "id": "18134517442739871", "text": "You can just make 2 reels", "timestamp": 1793371402, "like_count": 8}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfHkuG8Mazn/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfHkuG8Mazn", "we